{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y删减了部分关键的心理转折，尤其是S07“早知道这样还会不会走”的自问，以及S11“万一能呢”的短暂期待，人物摇摆的具体来由因此有所减弱。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住，话语中的关键词有明确视觉层级，感受描述也更常把抽象情绪落实为具体的身体感觉、声音变化和空间体验，并通过出现时机与音乐建立联系。X的优势是人物心理因果交代得更完整，尤其是反复动摇的原因、对过去的矛盾态度和最终决定之间的衔接；这些细节让整段经历更有连续性。总体而言，Y更适合实际观看和同步聆听，但它的精简确实牺牲了一部分心理过程的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0b79305c-765d-45f6-8983-ee9eba80e872", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T021748609847Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:18:22.453832+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d5300d203ea13eb4347a8914af17bb86dcc57de420ae5b8d1e8a06d2b10d3218", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",